# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT-SIDE config (this file → .env)
#
# Only ONE public value belongs in the browser now. Anything with a VITE_
# prefix is baked into the public JS bundle, so ONLY put non-secret values
# here. The Azure key is NOT here anymore — it lives as a server secret on
# Cloudflare (see "SERVER-SIDE secrets" below and the README).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY
# The PUBLIC Turnstile site key (safe to expose). Create a widget at:
# Cloudflare dashboard → Turnstile → Add site. Copy the "Site Key" here.
VITE_TURNSTILE_SITEKEY=your-turnstile-site-key


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER-SIDE secrets — DO NOT put these in .env / VITE_.
# Set them on the Cloudflare Pages project instead (dashboard → Settings →
# Environment variables / Secrets, or `wrangler pages secret put`). Listed
# here only for reference:
#
#   FOUNDRY_ENDPOINT      https://your-project.services.ai.azure.com
#   FOUNDRY_API_KEY       your Azure AI Foundry / Azure OpenAI key
#   FOUNDRY_DEPLOYMENT    e.g. gpt-4o
#   TURNSTILE_SECRET      the Turnstile SECRET key (pairs with the site key above)
#   ALLOWED_ORIGIN        https://your-site.pages.dev  (or your custom domain)
#
# Plus a KV namespace binding named RATE_LIMIT (see README).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
